<section class="section"><div class="shell prose reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Working together</p><h2>Therapy that fits you—not a script.</h2><p class="lede">Therapy with me isn’t about handing you answers. It’s a space to understand yourself more clearly, with curiosity instead of criticism, so the choices you make actually feel like your own.</p><p>Some sessions slow down to make room for feelings you’ve never felt able to express. Others focus on relationship patterns, family dynamics, perfectionism, or beliefs you’ve carried for years. Sometimes we turn insight into action—a boundary, a hard decision, or the next meaningful step.</p></div></section>
